$DATUM (3R,7R)-3-(tert-Butyldimethylsilyloxy)-7-(4-methoxybenzyloxy)-2,2-dimethyldodec-4-ynal
(13) To a stirred solution of alcohol 26 (1.30 g, 2.73 mmol) in dry
CH2Cl2 (34 mL) under N2 was added TEMPO (0.06 g, 0.384 mmol, 0.14 equiv)
followed by PhI(OAc)2 (1.32 g, 4.09 mmol, 1.5 equiv). The resulting
suspension was stirred at rt for 74 h, whereupon saturated aqueous
Na2S2O3 (40 mL) was added. The organic layer was separated and the
aqueous phase was extracted with CH2Cl2 (3 x 50 mL). The combined organic
extracts were dried over MgSO4, filtered and concentrated in vacuo. The
crude residue was purified by SiO2 chromatography (97:3 petrol:EtOAc as
eluent) to provide the target aldehyde 13. Colorless oil, yield 0.93 g,
72%. [α]D -18.5o (c 0.93, CH2Cl2). IR (neat): v 3373 (br m), 2955 (s),
2930 (s), 2883 (s), 2858 (s), 2223 (very w), 1715 (very br and w), 1613
(w), 1587 (w), 1514 (m), 1471 (m), 1464 (m),. 1442 (w), 1422 (w), 1389
(w), 1362 (w), 1349 (w), 1302 (w), 1251 (s), 1173 (w), 1134 (w), 1072
(s), 1043 (s), 852 (s), 837 (s), 776 (s), 670 (w), 540 (br w) cm-1. 1H
NMR (CDCl3, 400.11 MHz, 298.2 K): δ 9.62 (s, 1H, H11), 7.24 (m, 2H, PMP),
6.85 (m, 2H, PMP), 4.52 (d, 1H, J = 11.2 Hz, OCH2PMP) 4.40 (d, 1H, J =
10.8 Hz, OCH2PMP) superimposed upon 4.40 (t, 1H, J = 2.0 Hz, H13), 3.78
(s, 3H, OMe), 3.47 (complex m, 1H, H17), 2.48 (ddd, 1H, J = 2.0 Hz, 4.4
Hz, 16.8 Hz, H16a), 2.38 (dddd, 1H, J = 0.8 Hz, 2.0 Hz, 6.8 Hz, 16.8 Hz,
H16b), 1.70-1.15 (m, 8H, H18ab, H19ab, H2Oab, H21ab)), 1.13 (s, 3H,
C12-Me), 1.04 (s, 3H, C12-Me), 0.86 (t, 3H, J = 6.8 Hz, Me22)
superpositioned upon 0.85 (s 9H, Me3C of TBS), 0.12 (s, 3H, Me of TBS),
0.07 (s, 3H, Me of TBS) ppm. 13C NMR indicated the presence of
atropisomers (CDCl3, 100.6 MHz, 298.2 K): δ 205.4 C(11), 159.1
(quaternary C of PMB), 130.6 (quaternary C of PMB), 129.25 and 125.24 (2
x C, m- to C(OMe)), 113.7 (2 x C, p- to C(OMe)), 84.2 (C14), 79.86 and
79.84 (C15), 77.13 and 77.07 (C17), 70.9 and 70.8 (OCH2PMP), 67.9 (C13),
55.3 (OMe), 51.3 (C12), 34.0 and 33.97 (C18), 31.8 (C20), 25.6 (Me3C of
TBS), 24.85 and 24.84 (C19), 23.90 and 23.88 (C16), 22.6 (C21), 19.0
(C12-Me), 18.1 (quaternary C of Me3C of TBS), 17.27 and 17.26 (C12-Me),
14.0 (C22), -4.4 (Me of TBS), -5.4 (Me of TBS) ppm. HRMS: ES+ Calcd. For
C28H46O4SiNH4 = 492.3509 [M+NH4]+. Found = 492.3504.
