$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM To a solution of the alcohol 68 (49 mg, 0.091 mmol) in CH2Cl2 (0.5 mL)
was added 4 Å molecular sieves. Then, [bis(acetoxy)iodo]benzene (29 mg,
0.091 mmol) and 2,2,6,6-tetramethylpiperidine 1-oxyl (or TEMPO) ( 1 mg,
8.2 μmol) were added. The reaction mixture was stirred at rt for 16 h. It
was filtered on Celite® and washed with CH2Cl2. The filtrate obtained was
concentrated under reduced pressure. The crude product was purified by
flash chromatography on silica gel eluting with a mixture of hexanes and
Et2O (90:40 to 50:50) to yield aldehyde 15 (38 mg, 77%) and enamine 16
(11 mg, 23%), both as a white foams. aldehyde 15, yield (38 mg, 77%);
enamine 16, yield (11 mg, 23%). 1H NMR (300 MHz, CDCl3) δ (ppm) 9.72 (s,
1H), 7.76 (d, 2H, J = 7.7 Hz), 7.61 (d, 2H, J = 7.7 Hz), 7.40 (t, 2H, J =
7.2 Hz), 7.32 (t, 2H, J = 7.2 Hz), 5.41 (d, 1H, J = 16.0 Hz), 5.24 (dd,
1H, J = 16.0, 9.2 Hz), 4.45-4.30 (m, 2H), 4.22 (t, 1H, J = 6.6 Hz),
3.00-2.75 (m, 2H), 2.42-2.32 (m, 2H), 2.07 (s, 4H), 1.97-1.77 (m, 1H),
1.73-1.62 (m, 2H), 1.60-1.43 (m, 3H), 1.38-1.26 (m, 2H), 0.97-0.79 (m,
6H), 0.86 (d, 3H, J = 6.1 Hz), 0.84 (d, 3H, J = 7.2 Hz), 0.67 (d, 3H, J =
7.1 Hz). IR (CHCl3) ν (cm-1) 3368, 2952, 2920, 2870, 1723, 739. LRMS
(m/z, relative intensity) 543 (M+, 2), 525 ([M-H2O]+, 4), 472
([M-C3H6CHO]+, 5), 260 (55), 178 (100), 165 (90). HRMS calculated for
C35H45NO4: 543.3348, found: 543.3336. [α]D20 -34.4 (c = 0.98, CHCl3). 1H
NMR (300 MHz, CDCl3) δ (ppm) 7.77 (d, 2H, J = 7.2 Hz), 7.63-7.57 (m, 2H),
7.43- 7.30 (m, 4H), 6.88 (d, 1H, J = 8.8 Hz), 5.22 (d, 1H, J = 15.4 Hz),
5.04 (dd, 1H, J = 15.4, 8.8 Hz), 4.92 (dt, 1H, J = 8.8, 3.9 Hz), 4.42 (d,
2H, J = 6.6 Hz), 4.25 (t, 1H, J = 6.6 Hz), 2.65-2.60 (m, 1H), 2.32-2.25
(m, 1H), 2.06 (s, 3H), 1.93-1.83 (m, 3H), 1.77-1.51 (m, 6H), 1.43-1.22
(m, 2H), 1.03-0.70 (m, 3H), 0.85 (d, 3H, J = 7.2 Hz), 0.83 (d, 3H, J =
6.6 Hz), 0.66 (d, 3H, J = 6.6 Hz). 13C NMR (75.5 MHz, CDCl3) δ (ppm)
205.9 (s), 144.0 (s), 143.7 (s), 141.3 (s), 134.2 (d), 129.6 (d), 127.7
(d), 127.1 (d), 125.8 (d), 125.1 (d), 124.9 (d), 120.0 (d), 106.2 (d),
67.3 (t), 59.3 (s), 51.0 (t), 47.1 (d), 44.5 (d), 43.1 (t), 35.1 (t),
33.1 (t), 32.4 (d), 31.1 (q), 28.1 (d), 23.9 (t), 22.5 (q), 21.4 (q),
19.0 (t), 15.3 (q). 13C NMR (75.5 MHz, CD3CN) δ (ppm) 207.0 (s), 145.7
(s), 145.5 (s), 142.7 (s), 135.1 (d), 131.2 (d), 129.2 (d), 128.7 (d),
127.1 (d), 126.3 (d), 121.5 (d), 107.0 (d), 67.9 (t), 60.5 (s), 51.7 (t),
48.6 (d), 48.4 (d), 45.7 (d), 44.4 (t), 36.3 (t), 33.8 (t), 33.6 (d),
31.7 (q), 29.3 (d), 25.1 (t), 23.4 (q), 22.2 (q), 20.2 (t), 16.0 (q). IR
(CHCl3) ν (cm-1) 3072, 2952, 2921, 2843, 1715, 1659, 1321, 739. LRMS
(m/z, relative intensity) 525 (M+, 7), 260 (38), 178 (100). HRMS
calculated for C35H43NO3: 525.3243, found: 525.3254. [α]D20 -51.4 (c =
0.96, CHCl3).
